    "failure_scenario": "Two independent copies of the table-URL regex now exist in the same client bundle. If the route shape changes (e.g. `/t/:slug` grows a suffix or query param), a fix applied to App.tsx silently leaves cardSwallow.ts parsing the old pattern, breaking the swallow's POST silently (postCardReturned just returns false) while navigation still works — a hard-to-diagnose drift."
