    "failure_scenario": "No shared delay utility exists in this ship, so every new async-timing need reimplements the same three-line promise; low individual cost but it's the second occurrence, exactly the point at which a shared `src/shared/sleep.ts` should be extracted to stop a third and fourth copy from appearing."
  },
