    "failure_scenario": "Three hand-rolled fake-Spine HTTP servers now live in the tree with slightly different bodies (one captures `path`, one doesn't; one always 201s, two support failWith). A behavior fix to one (e.g. handling malformed JSON, or adding a delay-response mode for timeout tests) won't propagate to the other two, and a future contract change to the Spine's response shape has three call sites to update instead of one shared test/support/fakeSpineServer.ts."
  },
