    "failure_scenario": "If MtgCardShape gains a new positional/visual prop that matters for revert (e.g. a new transform field), the hand-rolled SwallowSnapshot silently omits it and a failed swallow leaves the card visually wrong in that field, whereas a history-mark-based revert would restore the whole shape automatically."
  },
