    "failure_scenario": "The envelope shape is defined twice (once as a validated incoming type, once as an untyped outgoing literal) with no compiler link between them; a field rename or type tightening in the shared Envelope interface won't flag the outgoing literal, so the send and receive sides of this ship's own contract can drift apart undetected until a schema-validation test catches it at runtime."
  }
